om_check\",\ncrates/pav_tools/src/tools.rs:191:        run: t_room_check,\ncrates/pav_tools/src/tools.rs:1585:fn t_room_check(_: &mut Session, a: &Args) -> Result<Output> {\n[package]\nname = \"pav_tools\"\nversion.workspace = true\nedition.workspace = true\npublish.workspace = true\n\n[dependencies]\npav_core.workspace = true\npav_render.workspace = true\npav_view.workspace = true\npav_audio.workspace = true\npav_ui.workspace = true\negui.workspace = true\nglam.workspace = true\nserde.workspace = true\nserde_json.workspace = true\nanyhow.workspace = true\nlibm.workspace = true\nminiz_oxide.workspace = true\nlog.workspace = true\npng.workspace = true\ntobj.workspace = true\ntoml.workspace = true\n\n[lints]\nworkspace = true","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019tgbSa68DQF3cJpPsPhhXx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
