{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkCaUhb37w6t3DPmWzMM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"While that builds, I'll write more story, in the same voice, to reach the plan's upper range of lines."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2163,"cache_read_input_tokens":766849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2163},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"189b0832-eeab-4401-af9a-06d1cd0033c9","uuid":"4108d386-dbc7-464f-9506-1a2e3a37e17a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T17:47:16.714Z","request_id":"req_011CgkCaTuy52d1ZKkQsdxbE"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkCaUhb37w6t3DPmWzMM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017ub9ibdGdrmRLV7us7B88d","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/story\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef L(who,expr,text):\n    t=text.replace('\\\\','\\\\\\\\').replace('\"','\\\\\"')\n    return f' {{ who = \"{who}\", expr = \"{expr}\", text = \"{t}\" }},\\n' if who!='narrator' else f' {{ who = \"narrator\", text = \"{t}\" }},\\n'\ndef after(f,frag,lines):\n    s=open(f+'.toml').read().split('\\n')\n    hits=[i for i,l in enumerate(s) if frag in l]\n    assert len(hits)==1,(f,frag,len(hits))\n    i=hits[0]\n    block=''.join(L(*x) for x in lines).rstrip('\\n').split('\\n')\n    s[i+1:i+1]=block\n    open(f+'.toml','w').write('\\n'.join(s))\nafter('case0','Where is Doctor Abara',[])if False else None\nafter('case0','The attending is elbow-deep',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Then get someone else. A registrar. A vet. There must be a vet in this building.\"),\n ('bashir','neutral',\"There was a vet, Doctor. He is holding the bus driver's other arm.\"),\n])\nafter('case0','Your hands were steady.',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"I dropped the first hook. I dropped it on the tray, I know, that's where it goes, but I dropped it.\"),\n ('bashir','neutral',\"Yes, Doctor. It is the only time this month anything has landed on that tray on purpose.\"),\n])\nafter('case0','It stopped once, Doctor',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Down the corridor, a net-mender is explaining to a very tired orderly that he has been stitched by an angel with cold hands.\"),\n])\nafter('case1','There are no routine appendixes',[\n ('mara','neutral',\"Yes, Chief. I'll try to be surprised adequately.\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"Do not be witty in my office, Doctor Quill. Save it for the morgue, where it is appreciated.\"),\n])\nafter('case1','You heard a knot',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She did not sleep. At four she went back and looked at the ligature, in its little steel dish, and it looked like a knot. It looked like a perfectly good knot.\"),\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She put her ear to the dish, and then she took her ear away, and she told no one.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','It has been a short night for promotions',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"Monitor Two now says rain, clearing by morning. I've decided to find that comforting.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','He just looked at me',[\n ('bashir','soft',\"Was it flat, Doctor? The middle C?\"),\n ('mara','soft',\"A quarter-tone. He went and checked, after. He never said a word. He just started taking me to work.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','I wanted you to know that I am not asking',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Eleven men went home to Terminal Row that week. The twelfth, who had carried them out, was discharged on the Friday and tried to tip the anaesthetist.\"),\n ('teddy','soft',\"I took it. I want that known. It was a very good bolt.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','This is my good coat',[\n ('vane','soft',\"And it has seen something, hasn't it? I can always tell. The ones who've seen something stand a little to one side of the room.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','Do try the little ones with the fig',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Above them the quartet turns a page. It is playing a waltz, as quartets do. Nobody in the atrium is counting.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','How did you know they went quiet',[\n ('bashir','neutral',\"Four. I counted four, Chief. Then the room came back.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','you will tell no one what you did not see',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"She has a family, Chief. Somebody's going to ask her what was in there.\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"Then somebody will be told four centimetres, benign, and to avoid heavy lifting. You are dismissed, Doctor. Mind the wet floor. It is always wet.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','Now you are thinking like a surgeon',[\n ('mara','stern',\"How many patients, Chief? How many in this city?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I have a list. It is shorter than the truth and longer than I can bear, and you will not read it tonight.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','For the end of you, Doctor',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"Sorry, I've come in halfway. Did she say designed? As in, by a person? On purpose? With a budget?\"),\n]) if False else None\nafter('case4','I have no guidance to give you',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Nobody? In eleven years?\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"There were two others. They were very good. I signed the forms myself. Wash to the elbow, please.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','The strains won',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"She saved a woman from a lung that was crying, Chief. She's allowed to fall over.\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"She is allowed, Doctor Lark. She is not excused. There is a distinction, and it is the whole of medicine.\"),\n])\nafter('case5','Are you waiting for a bus',[]) if False else None\nafter('case5','It has never once been the point',[\n ('teddy','soft',\"Is the tea any good?\"),\n ('pet','stern',\"It has killed two men and a pigeon. Would you like some?\"),\n])\nafter('case5','Of course it',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She finished the cup. She looked at the rain, and at the timetable, and at the young man holding her umbrella the wrong way up. Then she left six years on the bench and did not look round.\"),\n])\nafter('case5','We',[]) if False else None\nafter('case5','you pick tonight to start not asking',[\n ('voss','neutral',\"I asked in 1991, Perpetua. You told me a surgeon's hands are nobody's business, and then you took my registrar and my car park.\"),\n ('pet','soft',\"It was a very good car park.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','It has taken longer than I expected',[\n ('pet','alarmed',\"And the two you sent down there before the girl? Did you tell them what they were cutting?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I told them what I am telling you. That it keeps time, and that it is not yet finished with us.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','Is there a box for that',[\n ('voss','soft',\"Page four. I designed the form as well.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','She has been writing it for eleven years',[\n ('pet','stern',\"And the girl? Does Quill know whose canapes she was eating?\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"She knows she was told her hands were rare. By an expert. Find her before the expert does.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','He talks me through breakfast',[\n ('pet','soft',\"Nobody says it. We do it, and we hear it anyway. Now stop shaking, that's my job. Get the table.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','I still have the bruise',[\n ('bashir','soft',\"...Doc... tor...\"),\n ('narrator',\"\",\"It was the fifteenth way. Nobody in the room had heard it before, and nobody in the room said anything at all.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','Take the right. I',[\n ('mara','soft',\"You don't even like me.\"),\n ('pet','stern',\"I don't have to like you, girl. I only have to count with you. One. Two. Three. Four. Do you hear him under that?\"),\n ('mara','stern',\"Yes. Yes, there he is. He's in there. Seventy-two, under everything.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','mostly by accident',[\n ('voss','soft',\"I have reviewed the closure. All of them. I find it to be a kind of malpractice not to say so.\"),\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Say what, Chief?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I shall put it in writing. Do not get used to it.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','Elsewhere. A very good ship',[\n ('vane','soft',\"The lilies? Oh, send more lilies. One must always say thank you properly.\"),\n])\nEOF\nfor f in case*.toml; do python3 -c \"import tomllib,sys;tomllib.load(open('$f','rb'))\" || echo BAD $f; done; grep -c 'text = ' *.toml | awk -F: '{s+=$2} END {print s}'; cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-072416__x42677a/work/TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416/engine; sleep 120; pgrep -f \"cb.sh build\" | wc -l; tail -3 ../build0.log | cut -c1-300","description":"Add story lines, validate TOML, wait for build","timeout":200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2163,"cache_read_input_tokens":766849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2163},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"189b0832-eeab-4401-af9a-06d1cd0033c9","uuid":"9f483928-15ef-4157-96bf-4d88bf8d5db7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T17:47:51.679Z","request_id":"req_011CgkCaTuy52d1ZKkQsdxbE","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017ub9ibdGdrmRLV7us7B88d":{"command":"cd crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/story\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef L(who,expr,text):\n    t=text.replace('\\\\','\\\\\\\\').replace('\"','\\\\\"')\n    return f' {{ who = \"{who}\", expr = \"{expr}\", text = \"{t}\" }},\\n' if who!='narrator' else f' {{ who = \"narrator\", text = \"{t}\" }},\\n'\ndef after(f,frag,lines):\n    s=open(f+'.toml').read().split('\\n')\n    hits=[i for i,l in enumerate(s) if frag in l]\n    assert len(hits)==1,(f,frag,len(hits))\n    i=hits[0]\n    block=''.join(L(*x) for x in lines).rstrip('\\n').split('\\n')\n    s[i+1:i+1]=block\n    open(f+'.toml','w').write('\\n'.join(s))\nafter('case0','Where is Doctor Abara',[])if False else None\nafter('case0','The attending is elbow-deep',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Then get someone else. A registrar. A vet. There must be a vet in this building.\"),\n ('bashir','neutral',\"There was a vet, Doctor. He is holding the bus driver's other arm.\"),\n])\nafter('case0','Your hands were steady.',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"I dropped the first hook. I dropped it on the tray, I know, that's where it goes, but I dropped it.\"),\n ('bashir','neutral',\"Yes, Doctor. It is the only time this month anything has landed on that tray on purpose.\"),\n])\nafter('case0','It stopped once, Doctor',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Down the corridor, a net-mender is explaining to a very tired orderly that he has been stitched by an angel with cold hands.\"),\n])\nafter('case1','There are no routine appendixes',[\n ('mara','neutral',\"Yes, Chief. I'll try to be surprised adequately.\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"Do not be witty in my office, Doctor Quill. Save it for the morgue, where it is appreciated.\"),\n])\nafter('case1','You heard a knot',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She did not sleep. At four she went back and looked at the ligature, in its little steel dish, and it looked like a knot. It looked like a perfectly good knot.\"),\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She put her ear to the dish, and then she took her ear away, and she told no one.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','It has been a short night for promotions',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"Monitor Two now says rain, clearing by morning. I've decided to find that comforting.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','He just looked at me',[\n ('bashir','soft',\"Was it flat, Doctor? The middle C?\"),\n ('mara','soft',\"A quarter-tone. He went and checked, after. He never said a word. He just started taking me to work.\"),\n])\nafter('case2','I wanted you to know that I am not asking',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Eleven men went home to Terminal Row that week. The twelfth, who had carried them out, was discharged on the Friday and tried to tip the anaesthetist.\"),\n ('teddy','soft',\"I took it. I want that known. It was a very good bolt.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','This is my good coat',[\n ('vane','soft',\"And it has seen something, hasn't it? I can always tell. The ones who've seen something stand a little to one side of the room.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','Do try the little ones with the fig',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"Above them the quartet turns a page. It is playing a waltz, as quartets do. Nobody in the atrium is counting.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','How did you know they went quiet',[\n ('bashir','neutral',\"Four. I counted four, Chief. Then the room came back.\"),\n])\nafter('case3','you will tell no one what you did not see',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"She has a family, Chief. Somebody's going to ask her what was in there.\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"Then somebody will be told four centimetres, benign, and to avoid heavy lifting. You are dismissed, Doctor. Mind the wet floor. It is always wet.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','Now you are thinking like a surgeon',[\n ('mara','stern',\"How many patients, Chief? How many in this city?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I have a list. It is shorter than the truth and longer than I can bear, and you will not read it tonight.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','For the end of you, Doctor',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"Sorry, I've come in halfway. Did she say designed? As in, by a person? On purpose? With a budget?\"),\n]) if False else None\nafter('case4','I have no guidance to give you',[\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Nobody? In eleven years?\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"There were two others. They were very good. I signed the forms myself. Wash to the elbow, please.\"),\n])\nafter('case4','The strains won',[\n ('teddy','alarmed',\"She saved a woman from a lung that was crying, Chief. She's allowed to fall over.\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"She is allowed, Doctor Lark. She is not excused. There is a distinction, and it is the whole of medicine.\"),\n])\nafter('case5','Are you waiting for a bus',[]) if False else None\nafter('case5','It has never once been the point',[\n ('teddy','soft',\"Is the tea any good?\"),\n ('pet','stern',\"It has killed two men and a pigeon. Would you like some?\"),\n])\nafter('case5','Of course it',[\n ('narrator',\"\",\"She finished the cup. She looked at the rain, and at the timetable, and at the young man holding her umbrella the wrong way up. Then she left six years on the bench and did not look round.\"),\n])\nafter('case5','We',[]) if False else None\nafter('case5','you pick tonight to start not asking',[\n ('voss','neutral',\"I asked in 1991, Perpetua. You told me a surgeon's hands are nobody's business, and then you took my registrar and my car park.\"),\n ('pet','soft',\"It was a very good car park.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','It has taken longer than I expected',[\n ('pet','alarmed',\"And the two you sent down there before the girl? Did you tell them what they were cutting?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I told them what I am telling you. That it keeps time, and that it is not yet finished with us.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','Is there a box for that',[\n ('voss','soft',\"Page four. I designed the form as well.\"),\n])\nafter('case6','She has been writing it for eleven years',[\n ('pet','stern',\"And the girl? Does Quill know whose canapes she was eating?\"),\n ('voss','neutral',\"She knows she was told her hands were rare. By an expert. Find her before the expert does.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','He talks me through breakfast',[\n ('pet','soft',\"Nobody says it. We do it, and we hear it anyway. Now stop shaking, that's my job. Get the table.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','I still have the bruise',[\n ('bashir','soft',\"...Doc... tor...\"),\n ('narrator',\"\",\"It was the fifteenth way. Nobody in the room had heard it before, and nobody in the room said anything at all.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','Take the right. I',[\n ('mara','soft',\"You don't even like me.\"),\n ('pet','stern',\"I don't have to like you, girl. I only have to count with you. One. Two. Three. Four. Do you hear him under that?\"),\n ('mara','stern',\"Yes. Yes, there he is. He's in there. Seventy-two, under everything.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','mostly by accident',[\n ('voss','soft',\"I have reviewed the closure. All of them. I find it to be a kind of malpractice not to say so.\"),\n ('mara','alarmed',\"Say what, Chief?\"),\n ('voss','stern',\"I shall put it in writing. Do not get used to it.\"),\n])\nafter('case7','Elsewhere. A very good ship',[\n ('vane','soft',\"The lilies? Oh, send more lilies. One must always say thank you properly.\"),\n])\nEOF\nfor f in case*.toml; do python3 -c \"import tomllib,sys;tomllib.load(open('$f','rb'))\" || echo BAD $f; done; grep -c 'text = ' *.toml | awk -F: '{s+=$2} END {print s}'; cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-072416__x42677a/work/TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416/engine; sleep 120; pgrep -f \"cb.sh build\" | wc -l; tail -3 ../build0.log | cut -c1-300","description":"Add story lines, validate TOML, wait for build","timeout":200000}}}
