{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkJiEjsz9mZ2qF1cGAkJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've closed the four gaps the hook named, and **Trauma Tempo** is rebuilt, but no person has played it, so feel and difficulty are still unproven. On the final build, 66 of 67 tests passed. The one failure was a timing bug in the test itself; I fixed it and that test now passes on its own, without a full rerun.\n\n## What changed\n\n| Gap | Now |\n|---|---|\n| **Length** | Hazards now arrive in timed, repeating waves, so a case takes about the same time at any skill. The 0.7-skill bot spends about 33 minutes in operations, and there are 200 story lines (about 24 minutes at an estimated reading speed). That's roughly an hour by estimate. |\n| **Balance** | See the table below. |\n| **Native window** | I ran it under `xvfb` with real X11 keyboard and mouse: menus, Case Files, an operation, a wrong cut, pause and resume, with no panics. This also caught the OS cursor showing over attract, now fixed. |\n| **Full-picture browser checks** | With 3D on: 1080p screenshots of title, story, op, dev, about and results in `tests/out/full_*.png`, plus the DualSense flow, the phone profile and a one-player hub round. |\n\nWins out of 10 seeds per case:\n\n| Case | Skill 1.0 | Skill 0.7 | Skill 0.4 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0–2 | 10 | 10 | 10 |\n| 3 | 10 | 9 | 0 |\n| 4–6 | 10 | 10 | 0 |\n| 7 | 10 | 10 | 4 |\n\nThe full-skill bot should rank S or better everywhere, because I set each case's par from its scores. The test suite only checks that on Case 0.\n\n## What's still not proven\n- **Real hands:** gestures and balance were judged by a bot. The DualSense was a stub, and the audio was checked by signal levels, not by ear.\n- **Difficulty for people:** the 0.4 bot reacts about as slowly as a novice might, and it loses from Case 3 on at the default Attending difficulty. Resident is the easier setting, but I didn't measure it, so new players may find the game too hard.\n- **Length:** the hour is an estimate from bot timings and reading speed. The longer cases also repeat their waves with mirrored positions, so they may feel repetitive.\n- **Full-picture coverage:** the 4-player hub rounds, the two-copy hub test and most of the browser suite still use the UI-only mode, because software rendering runs under 1 fps here. Only one hub round ran with 3D on.\n- **Attract and other screens:** the 1080p story and results shots are real, but the results shot caught the card mid-reveal.\n\n## Feedback sections\nThese are unchanged from my last message except for the points below. The current text is in `exit-interview.json`, and the game's About screen matches it.\n- **Testing parameters:** now also include the full-picture pass and the native window run.\n- **Issues caught:** about 18, of which 3 were critical. The newest is the OS cursor over attract.\n- **Most helpful test:** still the bot and balance tool.\n- **Prompt, what was confusing:** the only judgement call was how to measure an hour with nobody to play it. I paced operations by script and estimated reading time.\n\n**Usage:** added on import.\n\nEverything is in `work/`, and I deleted `engine/target` again, so the next rebuild will take a few minutes:\n- `TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416/` (dev folder; `tests/run_all.py` reruns the tests, `tools/native_check.py` the native run)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1178,"cache_read_input_tokens":821774,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1178},"output_tokens":781,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"189b0832-eeab-4401-af9a-06d1cd0033c9","uuid":"d8f60fc7-b504-4ea0-b61d-e9d1a5d9d137","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:07:53.868Z","request_id":"req_011CgkJiEMom7D6aKmR8gXnt"}
