{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkLV7whzXo4dtTTHZC33","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final build now has one clean full test run: **93 passed, 0 failed**. The HTML wasn't rebuilt for this run, so what was tested is exactly what's in the folder.\n\n- **Hand-in list:** `tests/check_handin.py` checks 23 TASK.md and PLAN.md items, and all pass. They cover file names, exit-interview shape and values, hub tags and the unmodified client, the About block and credits, and no stubs or asset files.\n- **Full suite:** it covers the Rust tests (including 10 seeds of every case and the campaign), the browser tests, and the hub harness.\n- **With 3D on:** this now includes all four hub scenarios: 1 player, 4 players on a bad network, host leaving, and a server with no player. It also covers the 1080p screens, the DualSense flow and the phone profile. The two-copy hub test and most of the other browser tests still use the UI-only mode.\n- **Native window:** run earlier under `xvfb` with real keyboard and mouse. I didn't repeat it for this pass, but the code hasn't changed since.\n\n**Can't be done on this computer:**\n- A person playing it, a physical DualSense, listening to the audio, a real iPhone and a TV. TASK.md says these are checked only as far as the stand-ins allow, so pad, sound and touch were tested with its stand-ins.\n- So how it feels, how hard it is for people and the roughly one-hour length are still estimates from bot timings and reading speed.\n\nNothing else from PLAN.md is outstanding that I know of. The feedback sections are as in my earlier messages, and `exit-interview.json` and the About screen carry the current text. I deleted `engine/target` again, so the next rebuild will take a few minutes.\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- `TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `TraumaTempo-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261105-072416/` (dev folder)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":591,"cache_read_input_tokens":829355,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":591},"output_tokens":708,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"189b0832-eeab-4401-af9a-06d1cd0033c9","uuid":"ef915332-f880-4901-97d6-1b9de19016af","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:31:03.829Z","request_id":"req_011CgkLV7b8JpSGouempgDkx"}
