{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkLVwtkkbMi4YtKyMhcv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right that a section-by-section audit against the finished build isn't on record. I did read PLAN.md in full at the start, but I never checked it item by item. Doing that now from memory has already turned up real bugs in the hub client. Tool taps that fall between network sends get lost, and client copies get no music or callout voices because the snapshot leaves those out.\n\nI'll fix those, write the audit down, run the whole browser suite with 3D on, and rerun the native window on the new build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1009,"cache_read_input_tokens":829946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1009},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"189b0832-eeab-4401-af9a-06d1cd0033c9","uuid":"47ece6ba-e8b1-4c31-bbe1-0af26494e652","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:31:34.478Z","request_id":"req_011CgkLVwWRxwLgdG4HmwgNo"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkLVwtkkbMi4YtKyMhcv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018KNWU7ozS8PZEces6XKrH8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd engine; grep -n \"audio_capture\" -r crates/pav_tools/src | head -5; grep -n \"fn t_audio_capture\" -A30 crates/pav_tools/src/tools.rs | head -60\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/net.rs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''        \"pl\": f.plate,\n''','''        \"pl\": f.plate,\n        \"mu\": f.music,\n''')\ns=s.replace('''        map.insert(\"cl\".into(), json!([c.who, c.text]));''','''        map.insert(\"cl\".into(), json!([c.who, c.text, (c.age * 10.0) as i32]));''')\ns=s.replace('''        plate: num(\"pl\") as u8,\n''','''        plate: num(\"pl\") as u8,\n        music: num(\"mu\") as u8,\n        crisis: ((55.0 - num(\"v\") as f32 / 10.0) / 45.0).clamp(0.0, 1.0),\n''')\ns=s.replace('''            text: c.get(1).and_then(|x| x.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"\").into(),\n            age: 0.0,''','''            text: c.get(1).and_then(|x| x.as_str()).unwrap_or(\"\").into(),\n            age: c.get(2).and_then(|x| x.as_i64()).unwrap_or(0) as f32 / 10.0,''')\ns=s.replace('''        let g = decode(&v).unwrap();\n        assert!((g.vitals - 73.5).abs() < 0.11);''','''        let g = decode(&v).unwrap();\n        assert!((g.vitals - 73.5).abs() < 0.11);\n        assert_eq!(g.music, f.music);''')\ns=s.replace(\"let mut f = SurgeryFrame { vitals: 73.5, bpm: 96.0, ..Default::default() };\",\"let mut f = SurgeryFrame { vitals: 73.5, bpm: 96.0, music: 9, ..Default::default() };\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='crates/pav_app/src/product.rs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''    /// Latest snapshots seen, for status.''','''    /// A client's tool change and button edges, repeated until the host has surely seen them:\n    /// the messages are unreliable, and a tap can fall between two of them.\n    out_tool: u8,\n    out_pressed: u8,\n    out_repeat: u8,\n    /// Latest snapshots seen, for status.''')\ns=s.replace('''        } else if pr.hub.send_t >= period {\n            pr.hub.send_t = 0.0;\n            let mine = inputs[pr.hub.me.min(3)];\n            hub::send(&net::encode_input(&mine));\n            pr.hub.sent += 1;\n        }''','''        } else {\n            let me = pr.hub.me.min(3);\n            let mut mine = inputs[me];\n            // A cycle becomes the position it lands on, so a repeat can't turn it twice.\n            let ring_pos = f.and_then(|x| x.slots.get(me)).map(|x| x.ring_pos as i32).unwrap_or(0);\n            if mine.cycle != 0 {\n                mine.tool = (ring_pos + mine.cycle as i32).rem_euclid(8) as u8 + 1;\n                mine.cycle = 0;\n            }\n            if mine.tool != 0 {\n                pr.hub.out_tool = mine.tool;\n                pr.hub.out_repeat = 4;\n            }\n            if mine.pressed != 0 {\n                pr.hub.out_pressed |= mine.pressed;\n                pr.hub.out_repeat = 4;\n            }\n            if pr.hub.send_t >= period {\n                pr.hub.send_t = 0.0;\n                if pr.hub.out_repeat > 0 {\n                    pr.hub.out_repeat -= 1;\n                    mine.tool = pr.hub.out_tool;\n                    mine.pressed |= pr.hub.out_pressed;\n                    if pr.hub.out_repeat == 0 {\n                        pr.hub.out_tool = 0;\n                        pr.hub.out_pressed = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n                hub::send(&net::encode_input(&mine));\n                pr.hub.sent += 1;\n            }\n        }''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n '/^fn standings/,+3p' crates/pav_app/src/product.rs | head -2; grep -n \"fn take_mouse\\|send_t += \" crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","description":"Look up audio_capture; fix client input repeats, snapshot music and callout age"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":nu